{
"description":"The card sidebars: each case of cases starts from its card and runs its steps in order on the same card. The call card reads the data of the card; a step returns its value, throws its message, or returns no value. Each case of present states the presentation of the requested sides in a card rectangle; each case of grid states a size on the device pixel grid (docs/spec/example-model.md).",
"cases":[
 {"name":"a side without a choice follows the linked set","card":{"id":"main","data":{}},"steps":[
  {"call":"effectiveSidebar","args":["left",{"size":190,"min":120,"max":480},{"id":"first"}],"returns":{"set":"first","size":190,"collapsed":false}},
  {"call":"effectiveSidebar","args":["right",{"size":190,"min":120,"max":480},null],"returns":null}
 ]},
 {"name":"the stored size and collapsed choice apply to the linked set","card":{"id":"main","data":{"sidebars":{"left":{"size":240,"collapsed":true}}}},"steps":[
  {"call":"effectiveSidebar","args":["left",{"size":190,"min":120,"max":480},{"id":"first"}],"returns":{"set":"first","size":240,"collapsed":true}}
 ]},
